(16523,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Shattered Hand Savage'),
(16544,0,0,'Turn back while you can.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Ethereal Thief'),
(16544,1,0,'You will succeed only in damning yourselves!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Ethereal Thief'),
(16699,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Shattered Hand Reaver'),
(17000,0,0,'Fools!  You seek to abjure my father\'s presence?  Death awaits you, mortals!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Aggonis'),
(17015,0,0,'Wake up, Gal\'ressa.',12,1,100,1,0,0,'Taleris Dawngazer'),
(17076,0,0,'Thank you for allowing me to speak, A\'dal. I know many of your allies despise me and my knights for our treatment of M\'uru.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Lady Liadrin'),
(17076,1,0,'When he was given to us by \'Prince\' Kael\'thas, we believed his power would help us lead our people into a new age.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Lady Liadrin'),
(17076,2,0,'I\'ve come to realize our path was a false one. We were betrayed by the man we called our prince. In his lust for power, he sent the felblood to attack us, and to spirit M\'uru away to the Sunwell.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Lady Liadrin'),
(17076,3,0,'I... I don\'t understand. You -- and M\'uru -- knew all along that this would occur?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Lady Liadrin'),
(17076,4,0,'I see it clearly now. I renounce my loyalties to House Sunstrider and its false prince.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Lady Liadrin'),
(17076,5,0,'I pledge the blades of my Blood Knights to the defeat of Kil\'jaeden and the restoration of Silvermoon.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Lady Liadrin'),
(17076,6,0,'We will fight beside you, A\'dal.',12,0,100,66,0,0,'Lady Liadrin'),
(17117,0,0,'%s groans.',16,7,100,0,0,0,'Injured Night Elf Priestess'),
(17117,1,0,'%s sits up.',16,7,100,0,0,0,'Injured Night Elf Priestess'),
(17117,2,0,'Whe... Where am I? What... What is this place?',12,7,100,6,0,0,'Injured Night Elf Priestess'),
(17117,3,0,'BY THE LIGHT OF ELUNE! Eredar! Cursed demons, what have you done to me? I have not come alone, we will fight you as we have in the past! I...',12,7,100,5,0,0,'Injured Night Elf Priestess'),
(17117,4,0,'%s falls back into a coma.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Injured Night Elf Priestess'),
(17123,0,0,'Welcome, kind spirit.  What has brought you to us?',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Earthcaller Ryga'),
(17214,2,0,'Man\'ari... But how... We are not eredar! She must know! If there are others like her, we must find them and explain...',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Anchorite Fateema'),
(17215,1,0,'This should do it...',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Daedal'),
(17215,2,0,'Wake up little creature. Wake up from your slumber... You are safe now.',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Daedal'),
(17233,4,0,'Why do you do this?  Did I somehow wrong you in life?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Ghost of Uther Lightbringer '),
(17233,5,0,'Ah, I see it now in your mind.  This is the work of one of my former students... Mehlar Dawnblade.  It is sad to know that his heart has turned so dark.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Ghost of Uther Lightbringer'),
(17233,6,0,'Return to him.  Return to Mehlar and tell him that I forgive him and that I understand why he believes what he does.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Ghost of Uther Lightbringer '),
(17233,7,0,'I can only hope that he will see the Light and instead turn his energies to restoring once-beautiful Quel\'Thalas.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Ghost of Uther Lightbringer '),
(17241,0,0,'Adamant, could you please take a look at this tablet and try to decipher the runes?',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Priestess Kyleen Il\'dinare'),
(17241,1,0,'Thank you, Adamant. I think I know just the person for the job.',12,7,100,2,0,0,'Priestess Kyleen Il\'dinare'),
(17242,0,0,'Of course! Anything for you, darling!',12,7,100,5,0,0,'Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart'),
(17242,1,0,'Alright, let me take a look at that tablet.',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart'),
(17242,2,0,'%s slowly reads the tablet, mouthing the words in their native tongue.',16,7,100,0,0,0,'Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart');
