(18481,4,0,'Patience, general. The Light embraces all who enter Shattrath in good faith.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'A\'dal'),
(18481,5,0,'You are welcome in Shattrath, Lady Liadrin. We have long awaited your arrival.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'A\'dal'),
(18481,6,0,'Both our peoples have suffered greatly at the hands of Kael\'thas and his agents, Lady Liadrin. Your people were not the authors of their own fate, but they will die if they do not change.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'A\'dal'),
(18481,7,0,'M\'uru accepted his role in this long ago, knowing full well what would happen to him. Will you accept your own?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'A\'dal'),
(18481,8,0,'It wasn\'t I who foretold it, but Velen of the Draenei:',12,0,100,0,0,0,'A\'dal'),
(18481,9,0,'\'Silvery moon, washed in blood,\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,'A\'dal'),
(18481,10,0,'\'Led astray into the night, armed with sword of broken Light.\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,'A\'dal'),
(18481,11,0,'\'Broken, then betrayed by one, standing there bestride the sun.\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,'A\'dal'),
(18481,12,0,'\'At darkest hour, redemption comes, in knightly lady sworn to blood.\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,'A\'dal'),
(18481,13,0,'The Shattered Sun Offensive will surely benefit from the addition of your knights, Lady Liadrin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'A\'dal'),
(18481,14,0,'The battle for the Sunwell is but the first step on your new path, Lady Liadrin. Shattrath is open to you and all who follow you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'A\'dal'),
(18554,0,0,'You come into my house and threaten ME?  I think not!\'',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Sharth Voldoun'),
(18554,1,0,'My master, we are honored by your presence.  How may I serve thee?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Sharth Voldoun'),
(18554,2,0,'All goes exceedingly well, my lord.  Testing of the smaller prototype at the Cenarion Thicket was a complete success.  The second bomb is being ritually fueled in the courtyard below even as we speak.  And, I\'\'ve sent a courier to Tuurem to bring the rest of the parts to us here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Sharth Voldoun'),
(18554,3,0,'You are satisfied?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Sharth Voldoun'),
(18554,4,0,'I can assure you that we will not fail, my master.  I am personally overseeing every aspect of the construction, and I hold the final codes, myself.  Within a day\'s time, I will have the bomb detonated on those nearby pests.',12,0,100,2,0,0,'Sharth Voldoun'),
