(19666,0,0,'Never underestimate the other ethereal\'s greed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Shadow Lord Xiraxis'),
(19763,0,0,'Thank goodness you got here, it was almost dinner time!',12,0,100,3,0,0,'Manni'),
(19764,0,0,'I thought I was a goner for sure.',12,0,100,4,0,0,'Moh'),
(19766,0,0,'I don\'t know which is worse, getting eaten by fel orcs or working for that slave master Razelcraz! Oh well, thanks anyways!',12,0,100,66,0,0,'Jakk'),
(20071,0,0,'Let us hold our discussion in a more... private place. Follow me, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Wind Trader Marid to Player'),
(20071,1,0,'You didn\'t really think I\'d do business with you again, did you? Sometimes, the best way to return to profitability is to know when to cut your losses.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Wind Trader Marid to Player'),
(20342,0,0,'Yea, Nat?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Hal McAllister'),
(20342,1,0,'Which one?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Hal McAllister'),
(20342,2,0,'What you got in that pipe, Nat? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Hal McAllister'),
(20342,2,1,'Nat, I\'ve heard a whopper or two in my day but that one takes the cake. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Hal McAllister'),
(20342,2,2,'Impossible!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Hal McAllister'),
(20344,0,0,'Hal...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,1,0,'Had that dream again last night...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,2,0,'That one dream... The crazy one. Remember?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,3,0,'Tarren Mill is destroyed by some crazy force of undead and forever more becomes an enemy to Southshore.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,4,0,'Could ya imagine such a thing, Hal? Could ya?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,5,0,'That one where thousands of people are all watching us from up in the sky...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,6,0,'We\'re like their puppets - we dance and cry and fight and say silly things for their amusement. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,7,0,'Sometimes, even when I\'m awake, I think they\'re watching us. Maybe they\'re watching us right now...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,8,0,'So I\'m on some mountain with some big ol\' tree. Bunch of elves runnin\' around all over...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,9,0,'Out of nowhere, some 300 foot tall demon or somethin\' walks up and starts climbin\' the tree...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,10,0,'And if that weren\'t crazy enough, that big demon gets killed by a bunch of little floating light things... Oh, I was also a female elf in that one... Yep...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,11,0,'In this dream, I was fishin\' master of the world. I moved to some place called Kalimdor...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,12,0,'And people from all over the world come to me to pay homage... and learn to fish.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,13,0,'I\'m like some kind of fishing god...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,14,0,'This one\'s real grim... So the king\'s kid, Arthas... Well he goes out to battle evil, along with Uther... *Nat pats his brow dry*',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,15,0,'But tragically, Arthas is consumed by the evil and becomes evil himself...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,16,0,'Well, he comes back to the king all pretendin\' to be nice, draws his sword, and runs the king through, elbow to ... well you know... kills him on the spot.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,17,0,'I can\'t even believe this one... You know those two loud-mouthed ruffians, Foror and Tigule?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,18,0,'Well in this dream, they somehow end up inventing something called ice-cream and flavoring it with strawberries... Well, long story short, they end up striking it rich!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,19,0,'If that weren\'t crazy enough, they decide to quit the ice-cream business and become adventurers... They travel all over the place and finally disappear into some portal. I woke up in a cold sweat after that one...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,20,0,'That one where I\'m in Durnholde and that one orc that Blackmoore keeps as his personal slave breaks out...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,21,0,'He ends up destroying the whole keep, freeing all the orcs we\'re keeping in the camps, and rising to power as the king of orcs... Warchief or somethin\'.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20344,22,0,'Crazy, isn\'t it?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nat Pagle'),
(20350,0,0,'Keep your voice down, Helcular. Strangers abound...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Kel\'Thuzad'),
(20350,1,0,'Necromancy. It is called necromancy. And yes, I have it within my power to bless you with this gift.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Kel\'Thuzad'),
(20350,2,0,'That is none of your concern, Helcular, as you are neither Kirin Tor nor a necromancer.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Kel\'Thuzad'),
(20350,3,0,'But to be perfectly frank, I do not give a damn what the Kirin Tor think! They are fools, set in their archaic ways.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Kel\'Thuzad'),
(20350,4,0,'In due time, Helcular... All in due time...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Kel\'Thuzad'),
(20353,0,0,'So you can teach me this... this...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Helcular'),
(20353,1,0,'And the Kirin Tor? What have they to say of necromancy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Helcular'),
(20353,2,0,'Then teach me, Kel\'Thuzad. Teach me everything you know...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Helcular'),
(20763,1,0,'Commander! This fleshling rescued me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Captured Protectorate Vanguard to Player'),
(20763,2,0,'%s salutes Commander Ameer.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Captured Protectorate Vanguard to Player'),
(20763,3,0,'%s salutes Commander Ameer.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Captured Protectorate Vanguard'),
(21057,0,0,'Who dares to interrupt my operation?',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Nexus-Prince Razaan'),
(21104,0,0,'Victory or Death!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rift Keeper'),
(21104,0,1,'You are running out of time!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rift Keeper'),
(21104,0,2,'The rift must be protected!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rift Keeper'),
(21326,0,0,'The %s appears very grateful to be free of the koi-koi spirit\'s influence.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Raven\'s Wood Leafbeard '),
(21504,4,0,'For the time being, yes.  However, allow my presence to be a motivator.  Prince Kael\'thas was displeased with the failure of the crystal experiment on Fallen Sky Ridge.  This is one of the reasons for why we chose the Cenarion druids as the testing grounds for the bomb.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Pathaleon the Calculators Image'),
(21504,5,0,'I need not tell you what will happen should the mana bomb down in the courtyard fail to be used on its target soon?  Since moving into the forest, they\'ve become increasingly annoying to our operations: here, at Tuurem and to the south at the Bonechewer Ruins.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Pathaleon the Calculators Image'),
(21504,6,0,'I think that we should teach a lesson to both the Horde and the Alliance.  One that they will not soon forget!',12,0,100,5,0,7274,'Pathaleon the Calculators Image'),
(21504,7,0,'See to it that you do, Sharth, or I will personally see to your slow torture and death.',12,0,100,25,0,0,'Pathaleon the Calculators Image'),
(21504,13,0,'Rise, young Voldoun.  Do not worry yourself with pleasantries.  I come at the behest of our master, Prince Kael\'thas.  He bids me to check on the progress of the mana bomb.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Pathaleon the Calculator\'s Image'),
(21694,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Bog Overlord'),
(21838,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Terokk'),
(21838,1,0,'Show me what you\'re made of, $n!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Terokk'),
(21838,2,0,'Kwa! You cannot kill me, I am immortal!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Terokk'),
(21838,3,0,'%s becomes enraged as his shield shatters.',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Terokk'),
(22992,0,0,'Fool! The essence of the hawk will never be yours!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Guardian of the Hawk'),
(22992,1,0,'The time of the Raven is nigh, but yours will end here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Guardian of the Hawk'),
(22993,0,0,'You dare to disturb the loyal followers of the Raven?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Guardian of the Eagle'),
(22993,1,0,'You will die for your hubris, $c!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Guardian of the Eagle'),
(22994,0,0,'The falcon is vanquished, doomed never to rise again! Your quest is futile!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Guardian of the Falcon'),
(22994,1,0,'The raven will return to us as foretold in the prophecy and you are powerless to stop it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Guardian of the Falcon'),
(23083,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Shadowmoon Riding Hound'),
(23162,0,0,'Furious winds envelop Vakkiz as he writhes menacingly towards you.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Vakkiz the Windrager'),
(23162,1,0,'%s\'s flesh shatters in an unearthly rage!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Vakkiz the Windrager'),
(23282,0,0,'I believe that I shall feast upon both $r and ogre flesh tonight.',14,0,100,0,0,7274,'Obsidia'),
(23670,0,0,'For Ymiron!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Winterskon Elder'),
(23670,0,1,'I will break you!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Winterskon Elder'),
(23670,0,2,'I\'ll eat your heart!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Winterskon Elder'),
(23670,0,3,'Look what\'s come to play.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Winterskon Elder'),
(23670,0,4,'My life for Ymiron!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Winterskon Elder'),
(23670,0,5,'You tiny creatures disgust me!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Winterskon Elder'),
(23670,0,6,'Your race is a disease upon the world!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Winterskon Elder'),
(23782,0,0,'Reports from the test on the enemy fleet have come in, sir!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Apothecary Ravien'),
(23782,1,0,'Well... the good news is we forced the reinforcements to turn back.',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Apothecary Ravien'),
(23782,2,0,'The plague was not quite... fatal.  However, reports of harmful effects include nausea, loss of equilibrium and severe stomach pain.',12,0,100,274,0,0,'Apothecary Ravien'),
(23782,3,0,'Yes, sir!',12,0,100,273,0,0,'Apothecary Ravien'),
(24126,0,0,'Excellent.  What\'s the lowdown?  Do we have a bodycount?',12,0,100,11,0,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),
(24126,1,0,'Well, spit it out!  What\'s the bad news?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),
(24126,2,0,'Severe stomach pain?',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),
(24126,3,0,'SEVERE STOMACH PAIN?',14,0,100,15,0,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),
(24126,4,0,'We are the Royal Apothecary Society!  Inducing belly aches is not part of our job description!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),
(24126,5,0,'Am I surrounded by amateurs?  I want a full analysis of the new strain by tomorrow morning!  Get on it, Ravien!',12,0,100,25,0,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),
(24126,6,0,'We were making progress with our plague in Undercity.  All of a sudden our strains keep failing!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),
(24126,6,1,'The last ten strains from Undercity... all of them worthless!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),
(24126,6,2,'I cannot work under these conditions!  We need a viable strain!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),
(24284,0,0,'The vrykul clutches at his throat as he begins to gag and thrash about.',16,0,100,53,0,0,'Dragonflayer Vrykul Prisoner to Player'),
(24315,0,0,'%s sobs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Ancient Female Vrykul'),
(24315,1,0,'NO! You cannot! I beg of you! It is our child!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Ancient Female Vrykul'),
(24315,2,0,'I... I will hide it. I will hide it until I find it a home, far away from here...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Ancient Female Vrykul'),
(24717,0,0,'WHOA, WHOA, WHOA! Hold everything fellas!',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Stanwad');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `creature_text` (`entry`,`groupid`,`id`,`text`,`type`,`language`,`probability`,`emote`,`duration`,`sound`,`comment`) VALUES
(24717,1,0,'Oh dear lords of stone and steel, what... I repeat... WHAT are ya gonna do with that?',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Stanwad'),
(24717,2,0,'The dwarves all burst out in laughter.',16,7,100,0,0,0,'Stanwad'),
(24720,0,0,'If only our pappy were alive to see this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Needlemeyer'),
(24797,0,0,'The reef cow and her new bull find true love.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Reef Cow to Attracted Reef Bull'),
(24825,1,0,'Alert! Alert! Construct senses that enemies have breeched our defenses. Increase pace.',12,9,100,0,0,0,'Iron Rune Construct'),
(24825,1,1,'Construct class carrier reporting for duty. Primary function: Overseeing.',12,9,100,0,0,0,'Iron Rune Construct'),
(24825,1,2,'There is nothing to see here. Proceed with your mandated duties.',12,9,100,0,0,0,'Iron Rune Construct'),
(24825,1,3,'To interfere with construct\'s function results in termination. Move along.',12,9,100,0,0,0,'Iron Rune Construct'),
(24825,1,4,'Construct must not be questioned by iron dwarf servant. Commence deconstruction.',12,9,100,0,0,0,'Iron Rune Construct'),
(24825,1,5,'Construct is not authorized to communicate with lesser beings. Being must double their efforts.',12,9,100,0,0,0,'Iron Rune Construct'),
(24825,1,6,'Did you lose your wallet? Construct has found wallet with overabundance of currency.',12,9,100,0,0,0,'Iron Rune Construct'),
(24830,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Stonevault Pillager'),
(25167,0,0,'Why do you suffer the presence of this despicable Lady Liadrin? She and her followers distort the Light and make a mockery of all we stand for!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'General Tiras\'alan'),
(25317,0,0,'What\'s the matter, $c?  Think you\'re too good to stand in line with the rest of us?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Civilian Recruit to Player'),
(25602,0,0,'Now, $n, let us release their souls and hear what they have to say.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Greatmother Taiga'),
(25602,1,0,'This is dire news indeed!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Greatmother Taiga'),
(25802,0,0,'You challenge Kaw, destroyer of mammoths? Then face me and feel my thunder!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Kaw the Mammoth Destroyer'),
(25806,0,0,'Now THIS is a sport!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),
(25806,0,1,'KILL KILL KILL!!!!!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),
(25806,0,2,'I\'m sure ol\' Hemet can do something with your bones!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),
(25806,0,3,'Give it up, little beast!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),
(25806,0,4,'Just fifty more hooves and I\'ll have the new gun!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),
(25806,0,5,'No way! Rhino head helmet for the low, low price of thirty rhino heads? I\'ll take two at those prices!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),
(25806,0,6,'I wonder what Nesingwary will give me for your hide!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),
(25806,0,7,'It\'s gonna be veal tonight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),
(25806,0,8,'Nesingwary is going to go broke if he keeps this up! Lane probably has no idea what he\'s doing!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),
(25834,0,0,'You were looking for me, child? Why do you come to kill me, $n? I only wish to help.',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Gearmaster Mechazod'),
(25834,1,0,'Now that I have been reassembled, we can return to a time of perfection... the time of the Titans!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Gearmaster Mechazod'),
(25834,2,0,'But, I can see it in your eyes, hear it in your pulse rate. You would destroy me despite my offer of immortality!',12,0,100,25,0,0,'Gearmaster Mechazod'),
(25834,3,0,'Very well. It saddens me that it has come to this. I look upon all of you as if you were my children. I will slay you if I must!',12,0,100,25,0,0,'Gearmaster Mechazod'),
(25979,0,0,'Now THIS is a sport!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Hunter'),
(25979,0,1,'KILL KILL KILL!!!!!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Hunter'),
(25979,0,2,'I\'m sure ol\' Hemet can do something with your bones!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Hunter'),
(25979,0,3,'Give it up, little beast!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Hunter'),
(25979,0,4,'Just fifty more hooves and I\'ll have the new gun!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Hunter'),
(25979,0,5,'No way! Rhino head helmet for the low, low price of thirty rhino heads? I\'ll take two at those prices!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Hunter'),
(25979,0,6,'I wonder what Nesingwary will give me for your hide!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Hunter'),
(25979,0,7,'It\'s gonna be veal tonight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Hunter'),
(25979,0,8,'Nesingwary is going to go broke if he keeps this up! Lane probably has no idea what he\'s doing!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Loot Crazed Hunter'),
(26097,0,0,'Thank you for saving us. We accidentally uncovered the pieces of Gearmaster Mechazod and reassembled him.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Fizzcrank Gnome Ghost'),
(26097,1,0,'In return, he \'de-cursed\' us, saying that we were being \'fixed\' by returning us to the state of being mechanical constructs.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Fizzcrank Gnome Ghost'),
(26097,2,0,'He claims that all creations of the Titans fall prey to what he calls, \'The Curse of Flesh\'. He says that the original gnomes were once mechagnomes.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Fizzcrank Gnome Ghost'),
(26097,3,0,'He\'s quite insane! Someone must put a stop to his madness before it\'s too late for everyone!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Fizzcrank Gnome Ghost'),
(26287,0,0,'Thel\'zan\'s phylactery drops to the ground beneath Icestorm',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Icestorm'),
(26604,0,0,'Shcourged trooolls roashting....',12,0,100,396,0,0,'Mack Fearsen'),
(26604,1,0,'...on an open fire.....',12,0,100,396,0,0,'Mack Fearsen'),
(26604,2,0,'That\'s it! Far as I got... Whatd\'ya think?',12,0,100,396,0,0,'Mack Fearsen'),
(26666,0,0,'Stay your blade, Chieftain. He may yet have value to us.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Scout Vor\'takh'),
(26666,1,0,'Remember the dwarven journal that was discovered? Well, this dwarf could be exactly what we need to track down Brann Bronzebeard and capture him.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Scout Vor\'takh'),
(26666,2,0,'You will if you wish to keep your head attached to your shoulders.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Scout Vor\'takh'),
(26666,3,0,'Does that satisfy you, Tormak?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Scout Vor\'takh'),
(27210,0,0,'Now I\'ll show you the REAL power of the Onslaught!',12,0,100,0,0,14192,'High General Abbendis'),
(27221,0,0,'Let\'s see if this works.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),
(27221,1,0,'You are among the Taunka of Camp Oneqwah, dwarf.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),
(27221,2,0,'If you agree to help us against our mutual enemy, you will come to no harm here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),
(27221,3,0,'Think about it, prospector, but make up your mind swiftly. We must act soon.',12,0,100,25,0,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),
(27221,4,0,'I\'ll admit, dwarf, I was pleasantly surprised to see your plan succeed.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),
(27221,5,0,'We can\'t just let you return to your companions and we can\'t take you with us...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),
(27221,6,0,'He will live so long as he proves useful. I\'d be careful if I was you, dwarf.',12,0,100,273,0,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),
(27227,0,0,'Where... where am I?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Prospector Rokar'),
(27227,1,0,'Wait a minute here! You promised to spare me if I helped you. I held up my end o\' the bargain!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Prospector Rokar'),
(27227,2,0,'By the Light, Brann\'s alive? I\'d never help you capture him!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Prospector Rokar'),
(27238,0,0,'My beautiful mill. You! You\'ll die for this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Foreman Kaleiki'),
(27355,0,0,'No... NO! What have you done?! So many ancient wyrms wasted... what magic could do this?',14,0,100,1,0,0,'Rothin the Decaying <Cult of the Damned>'),
(27355,1,0,'Foolish errand $G boy:girl;... you will die for interrupting my work!',14,0,100,1,0,0,'Rothin the Decaying <Cult of the Damned>'),
(27355,2,0,'This is not the end... death only... strengthens...',14,0,100,1,0,0,'Rothin the Decaying <Cult of the Damned>'),
(27383,0,0,'I was... once like you. Mortal. Soft. Only flesh and bone. WEAK AND TIMID!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),
(27383,1,0,'Our lord, Arthas saw in me the frailty of man.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),
(27383,2,0,'"Serve me in life and I will promise to rend the weakness from your soul. To erase it from existence!" To be chosen... blessed by the Lich King in such a way.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),
(27383,3,0,'So serve him I did... Were it not for me the glorious dread citadel of Naxxramas may never have returned to Northrend.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),
(27383,4,0,'But enough talk... You have fought hard and come from the distant reaches of this world to face the Duskbringer. I shall not disappoint...',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),
(27383,5,0,'Just as our lord saved me, so too shall I save you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),
(27383,6,0,'THIS WILL BE THE LAST TIME YOU UTTER THAT NAME, PALADIN! Breathe your dying breath!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),
(27383,7,0,'Rise, my minions! Your master commands it!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),
(27439,0,0,'I know a place nearby where we can speak in private, my child. Follow me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'High Abbot Landgren'),
(27439,1,0,'Did you think that I could not see through your flimsy disguise, $N?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'High Abbot Landgren'),
(27439,2,0,'There is much that you do not understand, $R. The Master sees all.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'High Abbot Landgren'),
