(40875,0,0,'You\'ve gotten in my way one too many times, gnome.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(40875,1,0,'There isn\'t room in this town for both of us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(40875,2,0,'BRING IT, PIPSQUEAK!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(40875,3,0,'You think you\'re clever, don\'t you, ganging up on me like this... well, prepare to face: THE DREADSHREDDER!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(40875,4,0,'You think you\'re all brave facing me, eh, Steelsparks?! Those pig tails won\'t protect you from THE DOOMSAW!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(40875,5,0,'Yikes! That stings!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(40875,6,0,'Yeouuwch!!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(40875,7,0,'You gave it a good shot, kid. But this is goblin turf now. I suggest you get used to it.',12,0,100,273,0,0,''),
(40875,8,0,'Ciao, babe. Let me know if you\'d like to do lunch sometime. We\'ll work something out now that you\'ve learned some manners.',12,0,100,3,0,0,''),
(40876,0,0,'You have fully depleted my patience as well.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(40876,1,0,'I will attempt to not take undue pleasure in utterly destroying you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(40876,2,0,'Grrr... I was going to fight you fair and square, but you decided to bring friends. Fine! Behold the Alloy-Pounder Zero!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(40876,3,0,'Let\'s see how all of that dynamite in your pocket likes the KS-L10 Steelspark, Megs!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(40876,4,0,'Ack! Not the face!',14,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(40876,5,0,'Whaaaa!!!!!',14,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(40876,6,0,'You can be sure to tell Gallywix not to underestimate Gnomeregan anymore.',12,0,100,273,0,0,''),
(40876,7,0,'Until next time, Megs. Don\'t forget today\'s lesson.',12,0,100,3,0,0,''),
(40959,0,0,'Raaar!!! Me smash $r!',12,0,50,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
