(45410,0,0,'Chosen of the Elder Crone! You don\'t realize yet, do you? I\'ll put an end to you first! You and your friend!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(45410,1,0,'Spirits of the Firelands, fill me with your rage!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'in Battle Text'),
(45410,2,0,'Spirits of Skywall, heed my call!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'in Battle Text'),
(45410,3,0,'Why would she choose... an outsider?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'on Death Text'),
(45410,4,0,'Why would she choose... an outsider?',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Elder Stormhoof'),
(45447,0,0,'Thank you for the gifts. Let us see if you are worthy, $c!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Arikara'),
(45447,1,0,'Stop! You have bested my wind serpent.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Arikara'),
(45447,2,0,'I have been taken prisoner by the Twilight\'s Hammer.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Arikara'),
(45447,3,0,'I\'m not certain where. Start with their western base overlooking Highperch.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Arikara'),
(45715,0,0,'I owe you my life.  My people have paid a high price for defying Deathwing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45715,0,1,'I\'d only heard about your kind in stories, $r.  I never thought I\'d owe my life to one of you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45715,0,2,'I... *cough*  I thank you, stranger.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45741,0,0,'I will be goin\' now.  I have no reason to remain here.  I may be undead, but my will is my own.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45741,1,0,'I will see you in green fields on the other side, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45878,0,0,'Lorna, is that how you greet old friends?',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(45878,1,0,'My kingdom? My kingdom is no more.',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(45878,2,0,'Your father and Greymane saw to that... No, Gilneas died when they allowed murderous beasts to reign free. Unchecked.',12,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(45878,3,0,'Now lay down your arms and surrender. We are not here to kill you. Not yet.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(45910,0,0,'Is it safe?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45910,0,1,'Are... are they all dead?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45910,0,2,'They struck from the shadows. We didn\'t stand a chance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45910,0,3,'I thought I was done for!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45910,0,4,'You must be the hero that everyone is talking about. Thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45997,0,0,'So the Banshee Queen has sent assassins?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(45997,1,0,'Godfrey? So the rumors are true.',12,0,100,397,0,0,''),
(45997,2,0,'You would betray your kingdom out of spite?',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(45997,3,0,'HAH! You\'ll have to kill me! DIE!',12,0,100,11,0,0,''),
(45997,4,0,'%s falls unconscious.',16,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46768,0,0,'Active.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46769,0,0,'Online.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46986,0,0,'Some have spent decades meditating upon this mystery, Avuun. I do not wish the same fate upon you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46986,1,0,'The Light wishes suffering on none, my child. But it does not reign unopposed in our realm.',12,0,100,396,0,0,''),
(46986,2,0,'Even now, the true battle between the forces of Light and Darkness approaches. We will all be called to join, and in the face of this conflict, all mortal suffering will be meaningless.',12,0,100,396,0,0,''),
(46986,3,0,'Magtoor, you have endured your plight bravely. Are you ready to return to the embrace of the Light?',12,0,100,396,0,0,''),
(46986,4,0,'Then may the Light save you and raise you up.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46986,5,0,'Remember, Avuun. Not all who wander are lost.',12,0,100,396,0,0,''),
(47001,0,0,'Even now, nothing. Why? Why would the Light forsake the innocent?',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(47001,1,0,'Prophet Velen!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(47001,2,0,'...thank you, Prophet. You have given both of us great comfort. I will continue my work, in faith and memory of Magtoor.',12,0,100,273,0,0,''),
(47442,0,0,'I will do this ONE thing that you ask of me, quest giver. Pray I find more menial tasks to accomplish or you will be hearing from me again and I assure you that my commentary on forums of public opinion will be most unkind.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(47443,0,0,'Yes, cowardly quest giver, sit atop your pale horse while Orkus brings glory to the Horde! I shall return with a thousand skulls!',12,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(47444,0,0,'NORTH! GOT IT! THANKS! BYE! THANKS!',12,0,100,3,0,0,''),
(47602,0,0,'Huh? What?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Codemaster Deethuk'),
(47619,0,0,'A mirror? How wonderful!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Elementalist Starion'),
(47620,0,0,'Paratroopers?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Commander Fastfuse'),
(47872,0,0,'He killed everyone! EVERYONE!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(47872,0,1,'I won\'t soon forget this kindness, $r.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(47872,0,2,'It... they planted us in the dirt like crops! Stillwater is insane! Get out of here while you still can!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(47872,0,3,'M... maybe you\'re not all bad after all...',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(47872,0,4,'Should you ever be buried neck deep in a field of feces and urine, I will be sure to lend you a hand.',12,0,100,273,0,0,''),
(47872,0,5,'Thank you for saving my life. I owe you a debt of gratitude.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(48001,0,0,'This... this is perfect!  This disguise shall be my masterpiece!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(48397,0,0,'Ugh, the lok\'tar must have been cooking up a turd - which would explain the smell.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(48397,1,0,'By Hellscream\'s axe!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(48397,2,0,'You face Kingslayer Orkus now, dwarf!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(48397,3,0,'KASHA! Your master needs you!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(48403,0,0,'Oy, \'Linda, where are we meetin\' up with this Ivar Bloodfang fella? An\' what in Bronzebeard\'s name is that terrible smell?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(48403,1,0,'Look there, \'Linda! What in the...',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(48407,0,0,'They are massing at Purgation Isle, just west of us here, off the coast. We are to meet them there, general.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(48407,1,0,'As for the smell... *Balinda sniffs at the air* I think it\'s coming from over there...',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(48752,0,0,'Begone infidels, you are not welcome here!',12,0,100,0,0,19735,''),
(48752,0,1,'Death is only the beginning!',12,0,100,0,0,19733,''),
(48752,0,2,'May peace find you now.',12,0,100,0,0,19738,''),
(48752,0,3,'The heavens take you!',12,0,100,0,0,19736,''),
(49634,0,0,'At the bottom of the ocean even light must die.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,1,'The silent, sleeping, staring houses in the backwoods always dream. It would be merciful to tear them down.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,2,'There is no sharp distinction between the real and the unreal.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,3,'Even death may die.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,4,'There is a little lamb lost in dark woods.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,5,'All places, all things have souls. All souls can be devoured.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,6,'What can change the nature of a man?',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,7,'The stars sweep chill currents that make men shiver in the dark.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,8,'You will all be alone in the end.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,9,'Do you dream while you sleep or is it an escape from the horrors of reality?',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,10,'Look around. They will all betray you. Flee screaming into the black forest.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,11,'In the land of Ny\'alotha there is only sleep.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,12,'In the sleeping city of Ny\'alotha walk only mad things.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,13,'Ny\'alotha is a city of old, terrible, unnumbered crimes.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,14,'Y\'knath k\'th\'rygg k\'yi mrr\'ungha gr\'mula.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,15,'The void sucks at your soul. It is content to feast slowly.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,16,'The drowned god\'s heart is black ice.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,17,'It is standing right behind you. Do not move. Do not breathe.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,18,'Have you had the dream again? A black goat with seven eyes that watches from the outside.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,19,'In the sunken city, he lays dreaming.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,20,'Open me! Open me! Open me! Then only will you know peace.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,21,'You resist. You cling to your life as if it actually matters. You will learn.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,22,'The tortured spirits of your ancestors cling to you, screaming in silence. Apparently they are quite numerous.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,23,'The fish know all the secrets. They know the cold. They know the dark.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,24,'The giant rook watches from the dead trees. Nothing breathes beneath his shadow.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(54543,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(56686,0,0,'For 3,000 years, we have passed the knowledge of our people down. Elder to youth. Master to student.',12,0,100,1,0,27807,'Master Shang Xi'),
(56686,1,0,'Every elder reaches the day where he must pass on and plant his stave with the staves of his ancestors. Today is the day when my staff joins these woods.',12,0,100,1,0,27808,'Master Shang Xi'),
(56686,2,0,'$p, our people have lived the wholes of their lives on this great turtle, Shen-zin Su, but not in hundreds of years has anyone spoken to him.',12,0,100,1,0,27809,'Master Shang Xi'),
(56686,3,0,'Now Shen-zin Su is ill, and we are all in danger. With the help of the elements, you will break the silence. You will speak to him.',12,0,100,1,0,27810,'Master Shang Xi'),
(56686,4,0,'Aysa and Ji have retrieved the spirits and brought them here. You are to go with them, speak to the great Shen-zin Su, and do what must be done to save our people.',12,0,100,1,0,27811,'Master Shang Xi'),
(56686,5,0,'You\'ve come far, my young student. I see within you a great hero. I leave the fate of this land to you.',12,0,100,396,0,27812,'Master Shang Xi'),
(57692,0,0,'This is magnificent!  I\'ve never seen craftsmanship so fine.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(57692,1,0,'There is only one thing to do.  I must smash it!  Once and for all, all shall know the power of my mighty brow.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(57692,2,0,'Oh... my head... it hurts so badly!  I\'ve... the pillar must contain enormous power... perhaps stronger even than my brow...',12,0,100,18,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(57692,3,0,'I\'m... I\'m just going to lie down a while... until this headache goes away.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(58930,0,0,'I was barely inside their outer patrols when they caught me. I didn\'t find anything.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(59143,0,0,'I am in your debt.',12,0,100,2,0,0,''),
(59143,0,1,'I must rejoin the battle to save Binan Village.',12,0,100,2,0,0,''),
(59143,0,2,'Shaohao must have sent you.',12,0,100,2,0,0,''),
(59143,0,3,'We must drive the yaungol back to the Townlong Steppes.',12,0,100,2,0,0,''),
(59143,0,4,'You have great honor, stranger. Please join us.',12,0,100,2,0,0,''),
(59143,0,5,'Thank you. You have saved my life.',12,0,100,2,0,0,''),
(59143,0,6,'Join us, $c. We could use you in the fight.',12,0,100,2,0,0,''),
(59143,0,7,'That is powerful healing!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(62540,0,0,'What... where am I?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(63359,0,0,'Skeer the Bloodseeker has returned! Unnngghhh...',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(63359,1,0,'Yes, Klaxxi\'va. What does the Council command? Skeer hears. Skeer obeys.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(63359,2,0,'It appears that Empress Shek\'zeer has let our empire fall into chaos. This we must address. But first, I must regain my strength.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(65899,0,0,'Once you have learned to control your own actions, you must learn to control your opponent to gain the upper hand.  A slowed opponent allows you more time to attack, which can mean the difference between victory and defeat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(65899,1,0,'Bow to me and we shall begin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(65899,2,0,'I am defeated.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(65960,0,0,'Sometimes a well timed precision strike is all you need to take down even the toughest of foes.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(65960,1,0,'Bow to me and we shall begin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(65960,2,0,'Your power is impressive.  I admit defeat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(65977,0,0,'Some enemies gain most of their power from the weapon that they wield.  Take that away, and their power over you goes with it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(65977,1,0,'Bow to me and we shall begin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(65977,2,0,'Your power is impressive.  I admit defeat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(66138,0,0,'As a monk, your reflexes are among your greatest resources.  Often, the ability to think and move quickly can save your life.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(66138,1,0,'Bow to me and we shall begin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(66138,2,0,'Master Cheng is burning you alive!  Move!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(66185,0,0,'Father!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(66185,1,0,'Shut up.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(66185,2,0,'You raised me to be a killer.  How am I doing, daddy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(66185,3,0,'But wait... I remember now.  You taught me to only kill the undead.  So do you want me to kill myself, daddy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(66185,4,0,'Then again, why kill myself... when I can kill YOU instead!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68006,0,0,'Thank you for saving me from that nightmare. I wanted to rip everything apart!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68006,0,1,'I don\'t know what came over me. Thank you for clearing my head.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68006,0,2,'Thank you for saving me, soldier. You too, young prince.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68006,0,3,'I fought against the anger, but it overwhelmed me. You have my thanks.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'');
